<title>UK: Frankfurter Hypo sets 150 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurter Hypo sets 150 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Trinkaus and Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK CENTRALBODEN</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY  **13.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 13.MAR.98, THEN STEPS UP TO 5.375 IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED. OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 713</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
